
# Base Commit Template

# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
# | type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore
# | scope: optional, e.g. core, tasks, docs
# | summary: imperative tense, no period

# Example:
# style(core): add explicit self annotations

# --------------------
# Body (why / context)
# --------------------
# Use bullet points if multiple things changed.
# - Explain *why* the change was made.
# - Mention any tools that required the change (ruff, mypy, black).
# - If it fixes a lint rule, list the rule (ANN101, ANN201).

# --------------------
# Footer (issues, breaking changes)
# --------------------
# Closes #123
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe here if API breaks
